Acknowledgement

The shape of this project — a PreToolUse hook that refuses oversized reads, a
pair of named scripts that carry the delegation, and skills that tell the agent
when to reach for them — was inspired by the "shunt" plugin in
spotify/portal-ai-plugins (Apache-2.0, Copyright 2025 Spotify AB).

Understudy is an independent implementation. It contains no code from that
project, and it has no dependency on Spotify Portal, the Portal CLI, or AiKA.
Where shunt delegates through a commercially licensed CLI to a hosted AI
service, Understudy delegates through the user's own Claude Code installation.
